{#
  /specialties, the "what people struggle with" section landing. A ROUTING page,
  not a content page: it keeps to the lean key set COMPONENT_COVERAGE.md specifies
  for section landings (hero, lead, grid, cta) and deliberately carries no FAQ, no
  Service schema, and no support block.

  SUPPORT BLOCK, deliberate: this page links to the crisis-adjacent children
  (depression, anxiety, grief), but is not itself on the crisis-adjacent list in
  CONTENT_EVIDENCE.md, and each of those children carries the block itself. The
  sitewide footer block appears here as on every page.

  BRIEF: SITE_ARCHITECTURE.md had no per-page brief and no sitemap row for this
  URL when it was built, so the title, meta and H1 were authored to house
  convention and written back into SITE_ARCHITECTURE.md. Keywording is broad hub
  terms only. The panic/phobia/social-anxiety cluster (the largest untapped
  opportunity in the SEO baseline) belongs to /specialties/anxiety, not here.

  WHY THE GRID IS NOT THE `next:` FRONT-MATTER KEY: see the matching comment on
  /therapy. Cards are built from nav.json filtered on `published`, so this page
  cannot link a page that does not exist, and the same array feeds the ItemList
  schema so the two cannot drift.

  NOTE the `lead` macro escapes its text, so the cross-link to /therapy is a pill
  link below rather than inline prose.

  Gold discipline: hero CTA navy, single gold action in the closing ctaBand.
  No em dashes.
#}
{% import "components/sections.njk" as s %}

{% set specialtyCopy = {
  "/specialties/anxiety": { icon: "wave", body: "When worry has taken the wheel and the alarm goes off for burnt toast as loudly as for a real fire. Panic, phobias and social anxiety included." },
  "/specialties/depression": { icon: "sun", body: "When everything costs more than it should and the color has drained out of ordinary days. Not laziness, and not a shortage of willpower." },
  "/specialties/grief": { icon: "shell", body: "Grief is not a problem to be solved. It is the shape love takes when the person you love is gone." },
  "/specialties/life-transitions": { icon: "clock", body: "The middle of a big change, where you are no longer who you were and not yet who you are becoming. That gap is the work." },
  "/specialties/infidelity": { icon: "heart", body: "Rebuilding after a betrayal is possible, and hard, and not the same as pretending it did not happen. It also is not a courtroom." },
  "/specialties/conflict-resolution": { icon: "chat", body: "When you keep having the same fight. We work on the pattern underneath the argument, not just the argument." },
  "/specialties/neurodiversity": { icon: "compass", body: "ADHD and autism-affirming work that starts from how your mind is actually wired, rather than treating the wiring as the problem." },
  "/specialties/faith-based": { icon: "anchor", body: "For people whose faith is the frame the whole thing hangs in, not one more topic to bring to therapy." },
  "/specialties/addiction-recovery": { icon: "shield", body: "Compassionate support for the person in it and the people who love them. No shame and no lectures." }
} %}

{# Growth priority first (SITE_ARCHITECTURE.md weights anxiety and depression),
   then the rest in nav.json order. #}
{% set priority = ["/specialties/anxiety", "/specialties/depression"] %}
{% set ordered = [] %}
{% for url in priority %}
  {% for child in nav.sections.specialties.children %}
    {% if child.published and child.url == url %}{% set _ = ordered.push(child) %}{% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
{% for child in nav.sections.specialties.children %}
  {% if child.published and child.url not in priority %}{% set _ = ordered.push(child) %}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% set cards = [] %}
{% for child in ordered %}
  {% set copy = specialtyCopy[child.url] %}
  {% set _ = cards.push({ icon: copy.icon, title: child.label, body: copy.body, href: child.url, linkLabel: child.label }) %}
{% endfor %}

{{ s.pointCards({
  tone: "sand",
  columns: 3,
  eyebrow: "Start here",
  title: "Nine places people usually begin",
  cards: cards
}) }}

{{ s.pillLinks({
  tone: "paper",
  eyebrow: "The other door",
  title: "Or start from who is coming",
  lead: "If it is clearer to you who the therapy is for than what to call the problem, the audience pages are organized that way.",
  links: [
    { href: "/therapy", label: "Who we help" },
    { href: "/beach-therapy", label: "Beach Therapy" },
    { href: "/telehealth", label: "Online therapy in California" },
    { href: "/fees", label: "Fees and insurance" }
  ]
}) }}

{{ s.itemListSchema({
  name: "Counseling specialties at Laguna Beach Counseling",
  description: "The specialty pages at Laguna Beach Counseling, organized by what people are struggling with.",
  url: page.url,
  baseUrl: site.url,
  items: ordered
}) }}
